      "writtenOn": "2026-02-13T20:52:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Please conform that `pbi-\u003edecrypt_cb()` writes `n` bytes into `clear_buffer`.\n\u003e \n\u003e This will allow subsequent code to read three bytes from `clear` whether `clear` points to `data` or `clear_buffer`.\n\nThat is the [expectation](https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libvpx/+/ad17f6195cc6df6e4ac52bbb62b6b63e17c948a0/vpx/vp8dx.h#164), though without an error return we can\u0027t guarantee it.\n\n```\n/** Decrypt n bytes of data from input -\u003e output, using the decrypt_state\n *  passed in VPXD_SET_DECRYPTOR.\n */\n typedef void (*vpx_decrypt_cb)(void *decrypt_state, const unsigned char *input,\n                               unsigned char *output, int count);\n```",
      "parentUuid": "1c090923_be26a5ed",
      "revId": "cba6abc684aa47fea37dcf4489a7f5922c189580",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
